          %p
            %br/
          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#ExceptionalIsomorphism Exceptional isomorphism
          %p
            The A3
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dynkin+diagram"} Dynkin diagram
            coincides with the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D3"} D3
            diagram, hence with the result of removing one node from the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D4"} D4
            diagram. In the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classification+of+simple+Lie+groups"} classification of simple Lie groups
            this coincidence reflects the exceptional
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isomorphism"} isomorphism
            between
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SU%284%29"} SU(4)
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spin%286%29"} Spin(6)
